f636|---
f49b|date: 2026-08-20
4ea9|attendees: [Sam, Nate, Priya]
d461|source: 2026-08-20-checkout-latency-sync.vtt
e7d4|source-format: vtt
1a20|source-sha256: 3c9dca9b9ccf707d6e5ecb70a33e557d4c06781d5cb94a61097a2efa105a170b
